# HIT137 Assignment 3 – 

## Project Overview
This project is a desktop application developed for HIT137 Assignment 3 using Python, Tkinter, and OpenCV.
## Features
- Object-oriented Python implementation
- Image processing using OpenCV
- GUI built with Tkinter
- Difference detection system
- Mistake counter
- Reveal hidden differences button
- Multiple image support

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Tkinter
- OpenCV
- Pillow
- NumPy

## Installation
Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run Project
```bash
python main.py
```

